---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-cyan-300/10 bg-void/65">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-8 px-4 py-10 text-sm text-slate-400 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] lg:px-8">
    <div>
      <p class="prompt text-sm">cat /var/status/zpmlabber</p>
      <p class="mt-2 font-semibold text-white">ZPMLabber workstation online.</p>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-xl">Open-source developer tools, SDKs, packages, experiments, and engineering notes.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 font-mono">
      <a class="hover:text-cyan-200" href="https://github.com/zpmlabber">GitHub</a>
      <a class="hover:text-cyan-200" href="/search">Search</a>
      <a class="hover:text-cyan-200" href="/blog">Blog</a>
    </div>
    <p class="font-mono md:col-span-2">© {year} ZPMLabber / static build / no backend required</p>
  </div>
</footer>
